"text": " of this program."
},
{
"start": 216.89,
"end": 224.9,
"text": "But who is Martin Bashir and how did he get an exclusive interview with one of the most reclusive pop stars the world has ever known?"
},
{
"start": 225.84,
"end": 234.67,
"text": "In 1995, this little-known British journalist caused an uproar when his sensational interview with Princess Diana revealed details of her extramarital affair."
},
{
"start": 236.19,
"end": 239.97,
"text": "Since then, he has scored interviews with some of England's most notorious newsmakers."
}
